38:  budget; sandbox; how the team is dissolved and what it leaves behind.
39:- **Agent identity system** — agents as records identified by title/expertise (skills + memory + tools + model + track record), hybrid-specialty
40:  design, and an experiment harness that compares them.
41:- **The initiative engine** — how autonomous projects generate their own work (standing goals, heartbeats, signals,
42:  opportunity scanning), and how that stays aligned with the founder's intent.
43:- **Alignment and progress** — goal trees, "are we closer?" checks, detecting sideways motion and busywork, kill/pivot logic.
44:- **Coordination and non-interference** — ownership, leases, merge queues, shared blackboard, conflict resolution, so agents
