49:- **Skills and tools economy** — acquisition, evaluation, versioning, agents authoring new skills, retirement; MCP servers.
50:- **Economics** — subscription and token budgeting, cost per outcome, degraded modes when limits hit.
51:- **Human collaborators** — contractors, co-founders, customers and advisors inside the system with scoped access.
