docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-C-tooling-ecosystem.md:88:| Carrier | Twilio Voice | about $0.014/min US outbound | Numbers, SMS fallback, SIP |
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-C-tooling-ecosystem.md:89:| LLM bridge | Twilio **ConversationRelay** | +$0.07/min ([quiq](https://quiq.com/blog/twilio-voice-pricing/)) | WebSocket; Twilio handles STT/TTS; **Claude is the brain** |
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-C-tooling-ecosystem.md:90:| Speech-to-speech | OpenAI **gpt-realtime** (SIP, native MCP) | $0.06–0.11/min, mini $0.02–0.05 ([forasoft](https://www.forasoft.com/blog/article/openai-realtime-api-pricing)) | Lowest latency; GPT is the brain |
docs/vision-v3/r0-outward/R0-C-tooling-ecosystem.md:91:| Platforms | Retell ($0.07 base, about $0.11–0.15 all-in) · Vapi ($500/mo at 10k min) · ElevenLabs Agents ($0.08/min) | — | Median turn latency 1.96 s / 2.34 s / 1.73 s. Source is **Retell's own blog, so vendor-biased** ([retell](https://www.retellai.com/blog/retell-vs-bland-vs-vapi-vs-elevenlabs)) |
